    "description": "QD Laser, Inc. offers semiconductor laser-based solutions in Japan, the United States, Europe, China, other parts of Asia, North America, and the Middle East. It operates through two segments: Laser Device Business and Laser Eyewear Business. The company's products include semiconductor lasers/epitaxial wafers; and RETISSA display II, RD2CAM, RETISSA medical, and medical device products. Its products are used in silicon photonics, VISIRIUM technology, sensing, and precision machine equipment applications. The company offers its solutions to customers in various fields, such as communication equipment, life science equipment, measurement and sensor equipment, and display equipment. In addition, it manufactures and sells retinal scanning laser eyewear, as well as offers RETISSA ON HAND, a hand-held device; RETISSA NEOVIEWER, a digital camera and viewfinder; and RETISSA MEOCHECK, a compact device that applies laser retinal projection to enable self-checking of eye health conditions. The company was incorporated in 2006 and is headquartered in Kawasaki, Japan."
